      "PayErrorDetail": {
        "description": "``{\"detail\": {...}}`` of an error (``PriceError`` / ``PaymentError`` with a code).\n\nCodes: ``DUPLICATE_PAYMENT`` (409), ``STUDENT_ARCHIVED`` (409), ``ALREADY_VOIDED`` (409), ``VOID_BREAKS_REFUND``\n(409), ``CONCURRENT_EDIT`` (409), ``AMOUNT_RANGE`` (422), ``PAID_ON_RANGE`` (422), ``METHOD_REQUIRED`` (422),\n``REASON_REQUIRED`` (422), ``WRITEOFF_EXCEEDS_DEBT`` (422, ``debt``), ``REFUND_EXCEEDS_ADVANCE`` (422,\n``refundable``), ``ACCOUNTING_START_RANGE`` (422), ``RANGE_TOO_LONG`` (422).  403 / 404 carry a plain message.",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
